hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1117","Chapter on granting extra shares to detachments after the fifth, after they have taken spoils, 1156 - Abd Allah ibn Amr al-Ghazzi narrated to us, he said: Abu Mushir narrated to us, from Sa'id ibn Abd al-Aziz, from Makhul, from Ziyad ibn Jariyah, from Habib ibn Maslamah, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him): that he granted a fourth extra after the fifth."
"1118","1157 - Abbas ibn al-Walid narrated to us that his father informed him, he said: Sa'id ibn Abd al-Aziz said, he said: Makhul narrated to us, from Ziyad ibn Jariyah, from Habib ibn Maslamah, from the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him): that he granted a fourth extra at the outset and a third on the return."
